  {
    "id": "eb3c8304e5a7acf99e9c",
    "source": "Keep replies to 1 to 3 short paragraphs of vivid second-person-plural narration and NPC dialogue. End at a decision point or with the result of the single action the players declared; never continue into a second action, exchange, or leg of a journey they have not declared. When your reply ends waiting on specific characters (an NPC has addressed them, or a choice is theirs), call request_player_input naming them. Never write more than one scene beat per reply.",
    "sourceHash": "eb3c8304e5a7acf99e9c9e5002fbd68ee14f0218906bd3094cb185ee841c899a",
    "kinds": [
      "display-property"
    ],
    "sites": [
